                          "a": "The Freightliner eCascadia is a Class 8 electric semi truck, and the Freightliner eM2 is a Class 6–7 electric box and delivery truck."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What is the typical range?",
                          "a": "The eCascadia has a typical range of up to 230 miles. The eM2 has a typical range of 180 or 250 miles, depending on battery capacity."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How long does it take to recharge?",
                          "a": "The eCascadia recharges to 80% in about 90 minutes. The eM2 recharges to 80% in about 60 minutes."
                        },
                        {
